.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt PROCESS_WAIT 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm process_wait
.Nd wait for a process to terminate
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In process.h
.Ft int
.Fn process_wait "int pid"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn process_wait
function waits for the process with the specified
.Fa pid
to terminate and retrieves its exit status.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns the exit status of the terminated process.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr process_create 3